From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: anxelok <anxelok@localhost>
Date: Tue, 9 Jun 2026 22:00:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Diagnose and control tick drains

Measure chunk-loader and tick-start drain pressure, expose slow sections, and bound work that can consume a tick before world simulation begins.

